  "Usamos tus datos solo para responder a tu solicitud. Puedes pedir que los borremos cuando quieras.": ["We only use your details to reply to your request. You can ask us to delete them at any time.", "Usiamo i tuoi dati solo per rispondere alla tua richiesta. Puoi chiedere di cancellarli quando vuoi.", "Nous utilisons vos données uniquement pour répondre à votre demande. Vous pouvez demander leur suppression à tout moment.", "Wir nutzen deine Daten nur zur Beantwortung deiner Anfrage. Du kannst jederzeit ihre Löschung verlangen."],
  "Servicios prestados por proveedores con licencia.": ["Services provided by licensed suppliers.", "Servizi forniti da fornitori autorizzati.", "Services fournis par des prestataires agréés.", "Leistungen durch lizenzierte Anbieter."],
  "Fotos aéreas: PNOA cedido por © Instituto Geográfico Nacional (CC BY 4.0). Costa y relieve del mapa: MDT25 © Instituto Geográfico Nacional (CC BY 4.0). Ubicaciones: © Overture Maps Foundation (CDLA-Permissive-2.0). La información de cada lugar es orientativa.": ["Aerial photos: PNOA courtesy of © Instituto Geográfico Nacional (CC BY 4.0). Map coastline and relief: MDT25 © Instituto Geográfico Nacional (CC BY 4.0). Locations: © Overture Maps Foundation (CDLA-Permissive-2.0). Venue information is indicative.", "Foto aeree: PNOA concesso da © Instituto Geográfico Nacional (CC BY 4.0). Costa e rilievo della mappa: MDT25 © Instituto Geográfico Nacional (CC BY 4.0). Posizioni: © Overture Maps Foundation (CDLA-Permissive-2.0). Le informazioni sui luoghi sono indicative.", "Photos aériennes : PNOA fourni par © Instituto Geográfico Nacional (CC BY 4.0). Côte et relief : MDT25 © Instituto Geográfico Nacional (CC BY 4.0). Emplacements : © Overture Maps Foundation (CDLA-Permissive-2.0). Les informations sont indicatives.", "Luftbilder: PNOA bereitgestellt von © Instituto Geográfico Nacional (CC BY 4.0). Küste und Relief: MDT25 © Instituto Geográfico Nacional (CC BY 4.0). Standorte: © Overture Maps Foundation (CDLA-Permissive-2.0). Angaben zu den Orten sind unverbindlich."],
